/// 🧬️ This subset's OWN mutation vocabulary — one kind per ISO 10303-214 CC4 (manifold surfaces with topology) conformance
/// rule, derived from `check_cc4_conformance` below rather than copied from a sibling class, and
/// NOT the `🧱️base` subset's generic ISO 10303-21 graph editing. The module re-exports `🧱️base`'s
/// `StepMutation`/`apply_step_mutation` as well, since this explicit declaration shadows the glob
